OL,3,GNEWSASchool strike sparks counter
OL,4,Aprotest from parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff strikes led to parents staging
OL,7,Ftheir own rival protest at the school
OL,8,Fgates on Wednesday morning.
OL,10,FThe SEND school, Venturers' Academy in
OL,11,Fthe Withywood area of Bristol, has been
OL,12,Fparticularly affected because pupils
OL,13,Frequire all their staff to provide the
OL,14,Fsupport they need.
OL,16,FCharlotte, whose daughter attends the
OL,17,Fschool, said: "It's absolutely
OL,18,Fheartbreaking when I've got to watch my
OL,19,Fdaughter, who is non verbal, cry."
