OL,3,GNEWSASchool strike sparks counter
OL,4,Aprotest from parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe strikes from support staff took
OL,7,Fplace at seven of Bristol's E-ACT Trust
OL,8,Fschools over pay issues. Nathan
OL,9,FWagstaff at the NEU union said: "I
OL,10,Fthink we share the frustrations of the
OL,11,Fparents and we have tried to keep them
OL,12,Fin the loop."
